@host = http://localhost:5189

### Exercise types
GET {{host}}/api/ExerciseTypes

### Add an exercise type
POST {{host}}/api/ExerciseTypes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wykroki"
}

### The newest sessions
GET {{host}}/api/Sessions

### The exercises of a session
GET {{host}}/api/Exercises?sessionId=1000

### Statistics of the last 4 weeks
GET {{host}}/api/Stats?weeks=4
